00:40:24.440 --> 00:40:28.320
It's the small things that make
Buddhas. It's

00:40:28.320 --> 00:40:31.200
not the grand things, it's not
the big things.

00:40:31.200 --> 00:40:35.080
It's paying attention to the small details

