00:45:13.000 --> 00:45:20.200
It's just the tragedy of every living being;
every being in this universe

00:45:20.200 --> 00:45:23.400
has the same tragedy.'

00:45:24.600 --> 00:45:30.320
So, in truth, that communal tragedy
is the beginning of the Five Paths.

00:45:30.320 --> 00:45:32.600
Thinking about that tragedy

00:45:32.600 --> 00:45:37.720
is the beginning of the Five Paths for
